Full-colour logos for connections whose official logo has more than one colour or a
background shape (the single-colour Simple Icons glyphs lose it): Ubuntu, Linux (Tux),
CentOS, Raspberry Pi and AlmaLinux. Optimised with svgo 3.3.2; width and height are set
to the display size in points. The logos are trademarks of their owners and are used only
to show which system a server runs.

- ubuntu.svg: gilbarbara/logos (https://github.com/gilbarbara/logos), CC0 1.0
- linux.svg, centos.svg, raspberrypi.svg, almalinux.svg: devicon
  (https://github.com/devicons/devicon), MIT:

